   $q$Which statement best expresses the theme of the story?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Games about space are always more exciting than games about animals.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"overgeneralization"},{"text":"Laptops often break right before a big school project is due.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"topic-not-theme"},{"text":"It is better to work alone than to share a project with a partner.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"Combining ideas with others can create something better than working apart.","is_correct":true}]$q$::jsonb, $q$Combining ideas with others can create something better than working apart.$q$, $q$Lucia and Dev succeed only after they join their best parts into one game. Working apart is what left them with two broken games, so the idea that working alone is better is wrong.$q$, 'draft', '34a24473-b030-5f2d-9ad1-2a10249571c8')
