   $q$Which choice is the best summary of the story?$q$, $q$[{"text":"Mr. Okafor gets angry at the boy who shouted, and the volunteers decide to stop the bird count.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"adds-false-detail"},{"text":"At a bird count, Nadia speaks up that a reported owl was really snow, and her honesty is respected.","is_correct":true},{"text":"Nadia counts chickadees, sparrows and two bright red cardinals at the nature center feeders.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"too-narrow"},{"text":"Nadia spots the first snowy owl ever recorded at the nature center and becomes famous.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$At a bird count, Nadia speaks up that a reported owl was really snow, and her honesty is respected.$q$, $q$This summary includes the problem, Nadia's choice and the result. Counting the cardinals is an early detail and leaves out the central event.$q$, 'draft', '33545167-b92b-5b90-9991-d84dc4cb5d6f')
