   $q$How does Nadia respond when others want to add the owl to the count?$q$, $q$[{"text":"She leaves the room and asks her parents what to do.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"adds-false-detail"},{"text":"She agrees that it was an owl so the count will be exciting.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"},{"text":"She nervously raises her hand and explains what she saw.","is_correct":true},{"text":"She stays quiet because she does not want to upset anyone.","is_correct":false,"misconception_token":"contradicts-text"}]$q$::jsonb, $q$She nervously raises her hand and explains what she saw.$q$, $q$Her "cheeks felt hot," but she raised her hand and said, "I think it was snow." Staying quiet is what a person afraid of speaking up might do, but Nadia does the opposite.$q$, 'draft', '33545167-b92b-5b90-9991-d84dc4cb5d6f')
